}, {
"id": "dawn.c2.n3.leo.2",
"speaker": "nela",
"text": "It points to the Hollow. She went that way.",
"when": "leo"
}, {
"id": "dawn.c2.n3.nela.1",
"speaker": "nela",
"text": "Mum's boot prints. They lead into the Hollow.",
"when": "nela"
}, {
"id": "dawn.c2.n3.nela.2",
"speaker": "leo",
"text": "Then that's where we go. Later. In daylight.",
